    {
      "source": "never null.",
      "translation": "永不为空。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Adds a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> to extract the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> representation of a cache key if no suitable\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object.toString()</code></a> method is present.",
      "translation": "添加一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>，用于在不存在合适的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html#toString()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object.toString()</code></a> 方法时提取缓存键的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 表示形式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Enables time-to-idle (TTI) expiration on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> read operations, such as\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#get(java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.get(Object)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "支持在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>` 的读取操作（例如\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#get(java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.get(Object)</code></a>）上触发空闲超时（TTI）过期。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Define the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> used for cache key to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> conversion.",
      "translation": "定义用于将缓存键转换为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use the given <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a> to compute the prefix for the actual Redis key given the\ncache name as function input.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>，以缓存名称作为函数输入来计算实际 Redis 键的前缀。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> used to extract the cache key.",
      "translation": "配置用于提取缓存键的底层<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>TTL function</code></a> to compute the time to live for cache entries.",
      "translation": "将<a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>TTL 函数</code></a>设置为计算缓存条目的生存时间。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the configured <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取配置的<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a> used to compute a cache key time-to-live (TTL) expiration.",
      "translation": "获取用于计算缓存键生存时间（TTL）过期的<a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers default cache <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>key converters</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认注册缓存 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>键转换器</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Define the <a href=\"../serializer/RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair</code></a> used for de-/serializing cache keys.",
      "translation": "定义用于缓存键的序列化和反序列化<a href=\"../serializer/RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Define the <a href=\"../serializer/RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair</code></a> used for de-/serializing cache values.",
      "translation": "定义用于缓存值的序列化和反序列化的<a href=\"../serializer/RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the computed key prefix for a given cacheName.",
      "translation": "获取给定缓存名称的已计算键前缀。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determines whether time-to-idle (TTI) expiration has been enabled for caching.",
      "translation": "确定是否已启用缓存的时间到空闲（TTI）过期。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if <a href=\"#getConversionService()\"><code>getConversionService()</code></a> does not allow <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> registration.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果 <a href=\"#getConversionService()\"><code>getConversionService()</code></a> 不允许注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>Converter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Start with <a href=\"#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>defaultCacheConfig()</code></a> and customize <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> behavior using the\nbuilder methods, such as <a href=\"#entryTtl(java.time.Duration)\"><code>entryTtl(Duration)</code></a>, <a href=\"#serializeKeysWith(org.springframework.data.redis.serializer.RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair)\"><code>serializeKeysWith(SerializationPair)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#serializeValuesWith(org.springframework.data.redis.serializer.RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair)\"><code>serializeValuesWith(SerializationPair)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从 <a href=\"#defaultCacheConfig()\"><code>defaultCacheConfig()</code></a> 开始，使用构建器方法自定义 <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> 的行为，例如 <a href=\"#entryTtl(java.time.Duration)\"><code>entryTtl(Duration)</code></a>、<a href=\"#serializeKeysWith(org.springframework.data.redis.serializer.RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair)\"><code>serializeKeysWith(SerializationPair)</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#serializeValuesWith(org.springframework.data.redis.serializer.RedisSerializationContext.SerializationPair)\"><code>serializeValuesWith(SerializationPair)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Enabling this option applies the same <a href=\"#getTtlFunction()\"><code>TTL expiration policy</code></a> to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> read\noperations as it does for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> write operations. In effect, this will invoke the Redis GETEX\ncommand in place of GET.",
      "translation": "启用此选项会将相同的<a href=\"#getTtlFunction()\"><code>TTL 过期策略</code></a>应用于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>的读取操作，如同其应用于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a>的写入操作一样。实际上，这将调用 Redis 的 GETEX 命令来替代 GET 命令。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Redis does not support the concept of TTI, only TTL. However, if TTL expiration is\napplied to all <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> operations, both read and write alike, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> operations passed with\nexpiration are used consistently across the application, then in effect, an application can achieve TTI\nexpiration-like behavior.",
      "translation": "Redis 不支持 TTI 的概念，仅支持 TTL。然而，如果将所有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> 操作（包括读和写）都应用 TTL 过期机制，并且在整个应用程序中一致地使用带有过期时间的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache</code></a> 操作，那么实际上应用程序可以实现类似 TTI 过期的行为。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Use <a href=\"#enableTimeToIdle()\"><code>enableTimeToIdle()</code></a> to opt-in and enable time-to-idle (TTI) expiration for caching.",
      "translation": "使用<a href=\"#enableTimeToIdle()\"><code>enableTimeToIdle()</code></a>选择启用并开启缓存的时间到空闲（TTI）过期功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Requires Redis 6.2.0 or newer.",
      "translation": "需要 Redis 6.2.0 或更高版本。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following converters get registered:",
      "translation": "注册了以下转换器：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create default <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> using the following:\n<dl>\n<dt>key expiration</dt>\n<dd>eternal</dd>\n<dt>cache null values</dt>\n<dd>yes</dd>\n<dt>prefix cache keys</dt>\n<dd>yes</dd>\n<dt>default prefix</dt>\n<dd>[the actual cache name]</dd>\n<dt>key serializer</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>value serializer</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>conversion service</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a> with <a href=\"#registerDefaultConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>default</code></a>\ncache key converters</dd>\n</dl>",
      "translation": "根据提供的配置创建默认的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>，使用以下参数：\n<dl>\n<dt>键过期时间</dt>\n<dd>永不过期</dd>\n<dt>缓存空值</dt>\n<dd>是</dd>\n<dt>为缓存键添加前缀</dt>\n<dd>是</dd>\n<dt>默认前缀</dt>\n<dd>[实际的缓存名称]</dd>\n<dt>键序列化器</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>值序列化器</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>转换服务</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a>，并注册<a href=\"#registerDefaultConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>默认</code></a>缓存键转换器</dd>\n</dl>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> using the following:\n<dl>\n<dt>key expiration</dt>\n<dd>eternal</dd>\n<dt>cache null values</dt>\n<dd>yes</dd>\n<dt>prefix cache keys</dt>\n<dd>yes</dd>\n<dt>default prefix</dt>\n<dd>[the actual cache name]</dd>\n<dt>key serializer</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>value serializer</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>conversion service</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a> with <a href=\"#registerDefaultConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>default</code></a>\ncache key converters</dd>\n</dl>",
      "translation": "默认使用以下配置的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>：\n<dl>\n<dt>键过期时间</dt>\n<dd>永不过期</dd>\n<dt>缓存 null 值</dt>\n<dd>是</dd>\n<dt>为缓存键添加前缀</dt>\n<dd>是</dd>\n<dt>默认前缀</dt>\n<dd>[实际的缓存名称]</dd>\n<dt>键序列化器</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>值序列化器</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a></dd>\n<dt>转换服务</dt>\n<dd><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a>，并包含<a href=\"#registerDefaultConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>默认</code></a>缓存键转换器</dd>\n</dl>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create default <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> using the following:\n\nkey expiration\neternal\ncache null values\nyes\nprefix cache keys\nyes\ndefault prefix\n[the actual cache name]\nkey serializer\n<a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a>\nvalue serializer\n<a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a>\nconversion service\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a> with <a href=\"#registerDefaultConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>default</code></a>\ncache key converters",
      "translation": "根据提供的参数，创建默认的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>：\n\n- 键过期时间：永久有效\n- 缓存 null 值：是\n- 为缓存键添加前缀：是\n- 默认前缀：<实际缓存名称>\n- 键序列化器：<a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a>\n- 值序列化器：<a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a>\n- 转换服务：<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a>（包含默认转换器）\n- 缓存键转换器：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> using the following:\n\nkey expiration\neternal\ncache null values\nyes\nprefix cache keys\nyes\ndefault prefix\n[the actual cache name]\nkey serializer\n<a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a>\nvalue serializer\n<a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a>\nconversion service\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a> with <a href=\"#registerDefaultConverters(org.springframework.core.convert.converter.ConverterRegistry)\"><code>default</code></a>\ncache key converters",
      "translation": "默认使用以下配置的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>：\n\n键过期时间\n永久\n缓存 null 值\n是\n为缓存键添加前缀\n是\n默认前缀\n[实际的缓存名称]\n键序列化器\n<a href=\"../serializer/StringRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>StringRedisSerializer</code></a>\n值序列化器\n<a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a>\n转换服务\n带有<code>default</code>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/format/support/DefaultFormattingConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.format.support\"><code>DefaultFormattingConversionService</code></a>\n缓存键转换器",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Prefix the <a href=\"RedisCache.html#getName()\"><code>cache name</code></a> with the given value. <br/>\nThe generated cache key will be: <code>prefix + cache name + \"::\" + cache entry key</code>.",
      "translation": "在<a href=\"RedisCache.html#getName()\"><code>缓存名称</code></a>前添加给定值。<br/>\n生成的缓存键格式为：<code>前缀 + 缓存名称 + \"::\" + 缓存条目键</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Disable caching null values. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE</strong> any <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#put(java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.put(Object, Object)</code></a> operation involving\nnull value will error. Nothing will be written to Redis, nothing will be removed. An already existing\nkey will still be there afterwards with the very same value as before.",
      "translation": "禁用空值的缓存。<br/>\n<strong>注意</strong>，任何涉及 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#put(java.lang.Object,java.lang.Object)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.put(Object, Object)</code></a> 操作且包含空值的尝试都会报错。不会向 Redis 写入任何内容，也不会删除任何内容。已存在的键在操作后仍将保留，其值与之前完全相同。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Disable using cache key prefixes. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE</strong>: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#clear()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.clear()</code></a> might result in unintended removal of keys in Redis. Make\nsure to use a dedicated Redis instance when disabling prefixes.",
      "translation": "禁用使用缓存键前缀。<br/>\n<strong>注意</strong>：<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#clear()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.clear()</code></a> 可能会导致 Redis 中意外删除键。禁用前缀时，请确保使用专用的 Redis 实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Prefix the <a href=\"RedisCache.html#getName()\"><code>cache name</code></a> with the given value.",
      "translation": "在<a href=\"RedisCache.html#getName()\"><code>cache name</code></a>前添加给定值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the ttl to apply for cache entries. Use <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html#ZERO\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration.ZERO</code></a> to declare an eternal cache.",
      "translation": "设置缓存条目的生存时间（TTL）。若要声明一个永久的缓存，请使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html#ZERO\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Duration.ZERO</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Disable caching null values.",
      "translation": "禁用空值的缓存。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Disable using cache key prefixes.",
      "translation": "禁用缓存键前缀。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the ttl to apply for cache entries.",
      "translation": "设置缓存条目的 TTL。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>registryConsumer</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a> used to register a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> with the configured\n         <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a>; never null.",
      "translation": "<code>registryConsumer</code> - 用于向配置的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a> 注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Consumer.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 java.util.function\"><code>Consumer</code></a>；绝不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>classLoader</code> - the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> used for deserialization by the\n         <a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>classLoader</code> - 用于由 <a href=\"../serializer/JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</code></a> 进行反序列化的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheKeyConverter</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> used to convert a cache key into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheKeyConverter</code> - 用于将缓存键转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>registry</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a> in which the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>key converters</code></a> are registered; must not be\n         null.",
      "translation": "<code>registry</code> - 注册了<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>key converters</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if cache keys need to be prefixed with the <a href=\"#getKeyPrefixFor(java.lang.String)\"><code>getKeyPrefixFor(String)</code></a> if present or\n        the default which resolves to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.getName()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果存在，则缓存键需要以前缀 <a href=\"#getKeyPrefixFor(java.lang.String)\"><code>getKeyPrefixFor(String)</code></a> 开头；否则使用默认值，该默认值解析为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/Cache.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>Cache.getName()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> used for cache key to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> conversion. Never null.",
      "translation": "用于将缓存键转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>。绝不为空。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> to <code>byte byte[]</code> using UTF-8 encoding.",
      "translation": "将<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>转换为<code>byte byte[]</code>，使用 UTF-8 编码。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ttlFunction</code> - the <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a> to compute the time to live for cache entries, must not be\n         null.",
      "translation": "<code>ttlFunction</code> - 用于计算缓存条目生存时间的 <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a>，不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the configured <a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置的<a href=\"CacheKeyPrefix.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>CacheKeyPrefix</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a> used to compute expiration time (TTL) for cache entries; never null.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.cache 中的接口\"><code>RedisCacheWriter.TtlFunction</code></a> 用于计算缓存条目的过期时间（TTL）；该值永远不为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>prefix</code> - the prefix to prepend to the cache name.",
      "translation": "<code>prefix</code> - 附加到缓存名称前缀的字符串。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>cacheKeyPrefix</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>cacheKeyPrefix</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ttl</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>ttl</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>keySerializationPair</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>keySerializationPair</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>valueSerializationPair</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>valueSerializationPair</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>conversionService</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>conversionService</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl, Mark Paluch, John Blum",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布，马克·帕卢赫，约翰·布鲁姆",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if caching null is allowed.",
      "translation": "如果允许缓存 null，则为 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if time-to-idle (TTI) expiration was configured and enabled for caching.\n        Defaults to false.",
      "translation": "如果已配置并启用缓存的时间到空闲（TTI）过期，则返回 true。  \n默认值为 false。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Field Details",
      "translation": "字段详情",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Immutable <a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a> used to customize <a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a> behavior, such as caching\nnull values, computing cache key prefixes and handling binary serialization.",
      "translation": "不可变的<a href=\"RedisCacheConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCacheConfiguration</code></a>类用于自定义<a href=\"RedisCache.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.cache\"><code>RedisCache</code></a>的行为，例如缓存 null 值、计算缓存键前缀以及处理二进制序列化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul>\n<li>将<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>转换为<code>byte byte[]</code>，使用 UTF-8 编码。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/interceptor/SimpleKey.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>SimpleKey</code></a> to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul>\n<li>将<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>转换为<code>byte[]</code>，使用 UTF-8 编码。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/interceptor/SimpleKey.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.interceptor\"><code>SimpleKey</code></a>转换为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
